- Contents: a task router with a Map-based state machine and turn/token budgets, plus an Agent Card builder with no HTTP server. 868 LOC.
- Existing owners:
  - `core/orchestration/src/a2a/dispatcher.ts` (dispatch);
  - `core/poly-compiler/src/projections.ts:83` `projectArtifactToA2A` (Agent Card);
  - `core/domain/src/poly-protocol/surface.ts:17` (the `a2a` surface kind).
- It also mints CLI verbs `a2a card|discover|task` from a leaf package (failure mode 15).

- Duplicates:
  - prompt-injection scanner → `plugins/guardrails` (5/5);
  - `Receipt`/`EvalOutcome` → core/effect and core/eval;
  - hash-chained audit log → the execution-ledger segment integrity;
  - loop guard and rate limiter → orchestration budgets.
- New: taint labels with propagation, and `isURLSafe`. Tested; the whole package is 25/25 under bun.
